/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
/apps/desktop/src-tauri/target
/data
*.log
.env

# 多实例运行目录（scripts/instances.ps1）：每个实例带自己的 data/workspace/bin/run
/instances

# The markdown/diagram harness is scaffolding: written, run and deleted, never committed.
apps/web/mdcheck
apps/web/mdcheck-dist

# The default archive root (storage.archive_dir). Archived conversations are the user's data and
# belong on disk, not in the repository.
/archives

# The default workspace root (policy.workspace_root). One directory per workspace, and everything a
# capability may write lives under it - which is user data for the same reason /data is.
/workspace
